# src/go: the `go build -buildmode=c-archive` output. Emitted by
# src/go/build.rs at OUT_DIR, and occasionally produced at the
# crate root when running `go build` ad-hoc.
/src/go/libceleste_go.a
/src/go/libceleste_go.h

# Cargo's per-crate artefacts when the sys crate is built standalone
# (e.g. `cargo run --manifest-path src/go/Cargo.toml --example …`).
# The authoritative Cargo.lock lives at the repo root alongside the
# main Celeste crate.
/src/go/target
/src/go/Cargo.lock

